  "$comment": [
    "Shared fixture of workspace decision 0086 (runbook docs/runbooks/handles-build.md step 1), generated by",
    "cofferdam-sdk packages/core/test/fixtures/buildHandleFixture.ts; never edit by hand. Test keys only.",
